<title>MALAYSIA: Amalgamated Containers stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Amalgamated Containers stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Malaysia's Amalgamated Containers Bhd was suspended on Tuesday pending a company announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of the maker and seller of dry cargo containers and iron and steel products last traded up 98 cents at 4.96 ringgit on Tuesday before the trading halt. The shares hit a new 52-week high of 5.15 ringgit earlier today.  </p>
<p>An official at Amalgamated Containers said the company was still finalising the announcement.</p>
<p>She declined to provide details on the news.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
